// Static UI-chrome strings: navigation, buttons, headings, shared messages.
// Separate from the AI on-demand translation used for product content/catalogues
// (lib/useAI.ts), which translates artisan-authored text at generation time.
// This file translates the app's own interface text, once, ahead of time.
//
// All 23 languages in lib/languages.ts are fully translated here (verified —
// every language has 100% key coverage against English; see
// tests/translations.test.ts). A language missing a key falls back to
// English for that key rather than showing a raw key string or breaking —
// see getTranslations() below — but that should be a temporary gap right
// after a new key is added, not a standing state for any language. Add a
// language by adding its key here; add a key by adding it to every language
// block, not just `en`.

